# All vars are optional. The app runs with zero configuration —
# story/image/narration all use free, keyless services.
#
# OPTIONAL: enable a SHARED CLOUD LIBRARY so every story made by any
# user shows up for everyone. Without these set, the library falls
# back to per-device IndexedDB (only the kid who made the story sees
# it). Set up a free Upstash Redis instance at upstash.com (or via
# Vercel → Storage → Connect Database → Upstash) to get these values.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# OPTIONAL: override the Pollinations text model.
# Common values: openai (default, GPT-class), mistral, llama, deepseek, gemini.
# STORY_MODEL=openai
